WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.869
Clean-up options. To make room, the other sections are folded: click a section title to fold or unfold it.

00:00:07.969 --> 00:00:15.799
Invert negative scans: white text on black (microfilm) becomes normal.

00:00:15.899 --> 00:00:23.238
Auto contrast (levels) stretches dull scans to the full range.

00:00:23.338 --> 00:00:35.092
Remove show-through erases print seen from the other side of thin paper; Smooth halftone (descreen) removes the screen dots of printed pictures.

00:00:35.192 --> 00:00:46.488
The two page 2 options: first the punch holes. Select the page with holes and tick Remove punch holes.

00:00:46.588 --> 00:01:02.875
Phone photos: pick the photo, then Fix perspective straightens the page, and Wipe the background removes the table around it.

00:01:02.975 --> 00:01:09.337
Remove fingers at the edge paints out a thumb holding the page, without touching the print.

00:01:09.437 --> 00:01:18.100
Drop colour removes one ink colour before black-and-white conversion; Sharpen makes the text crisper.

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:28.911
Erase zones takes rectangles in millimetres (x,y,w,h) as text, the same ones you can draw with the mouse.
